1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Your cruise control stopped working —

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,000
and it might not be the cruise system.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Shifter feels stuck in park too.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Brake lights still look fine when you check them.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,800
One clue: a worn brake light switch.

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,000
It tells the computer the pedal was pressed.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
If that signal doesn't get through,

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
cruise control and shift-lock release can both stay off.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't guess which module is bad.

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
The switch is a simple, common check first.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before you chase the wrong part.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
